.env*

# Re-asserted here since it must win over every .env*/*.md ignore pattern
# above (gitignore evaluates rules in order - a negation only takes effect
# if it's the LAST matching rule for a given path).
!.env.example
!docs/SECURITY.md
!RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md
